{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"3f5b39eb02d7a1d6766cabadd5a21eb777a96ecc4aafa2082814665aaa8ba329","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"谁像有智慧的人呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁知道事情的原委呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"智慧能使人容光焕发，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使冷酷的面孔柔和。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我劝你遵守王的命令，因为你曾在上帝面前这样发誓。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["不要在王面前鲁莽行事，也不要参与恶行，因为王可以随意行事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["况且，王的命令至高无上，谁敢质问他：“你在做什么？”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["遵从王命的必免遭祸患，因为智者心里懂得做事的时机和方法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["尽管人面临重重困难，但做任何事都有时机和方法。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["无人知道未来的事，谁能告诉人将来的事呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["无人能掌管生命",{"noteId":4},"，留住生命，也无人能掌管死期。无人能免于这场争战，邪恶也救不了作恶者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这一切我都见过了，我用心思考日光之下的一切事。有时人欺压人，使人受伤害。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我看见恶人死后被安葬。他们生前出入圣所，还在他们作恶的城中受到称赞，这也是虚空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["对犯罪者的刑罚不迅速执行，世人便尽情作恶。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["虽然罪人作恶多端仍得长寿，我却认为敬畏上帝的人必亨通，因为他们对上帝心存敬畏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["然而，恶人得不到祝福，他们必像幻影一样不能长久，因为他们不敬畏上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["世上有一件虚空的事，就是义人遭受了恶人当受的报应，恶人却享受了义人该享的福乐。我认为这也是虚空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["因此，我便赞赏享乐，因为在日光之下没有什么比吃喝快乐更好。这是人在上帝所赐的年日里，从劳碌中当得的享受。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我全心去寻求智慧，观察世上所发生的事，甚至昼夜不眠，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我看清了上帝的一切作为，便知道人无法理解日光之下所发生的事。尽管人努力不懈地去寻找，也找不到答案；即使智者自以为明白，他其实仍不能参透。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"“生命”也可译作“风”或“气息”。","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}